### 장바구니 기반 주문 생성
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{loginId}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{loginPw}}

{
  "cartItemIds": [1, 2]
}

### 바로구매 주문 생성
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders/direct
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{loginId}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{loginPw}}

{
  "optionId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 주문 내역 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{loginId}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{loginPw}}

### 주문 상세 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{loginId}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{loginPw}}

### 주문 취소
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders/1/cancel
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{loginId}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{loginPw}}
